      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Acknowledgements",
      "pageStart": 7,
      "pageEnd": 8,
      "target": "../sections/sec-000-acknowledgements.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Work on this guidance was initiated by A. Metin Gülmezoglu (Department of Reproductive Health and Research, WHO), \nMatthews Mathai, Rajiv Bahl, and Blerta Maliqi (Department of Maternal, Newborn, Child and Adolescent Health, WHO), and \nCarmen Dolea (Health Policy, Development and Services, WHO). \nA. Metin Gülmezoglu (WHO) coordinated the guidance project with Simon Lewin and Claire Glenton (The Norwegian Knowledge \nCentre for the Health Services – NOKC). Olufemi Oladapo wrote the background document for the scoping meeting and \nA. Metin Gülmezoglu, Simon Lewin and Claire Glenton provided addit",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Acknowledges those who initiated and wrote the OptimizeMNH guidance, led by A. Metin Gülmezoglu of WHO with Simon Lewin and Claire Glenton of the Norwegian Knowledge Centre, with Chapter 5 and Annex 8 written by John Lavis and Elizabeth Alvarez. It also thanks guidance panel members, systematic review authors and NORAD for support.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
